# Normalise line endings so every clone — Windows, Linux, or a CI runner — produces
# identical files. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites LF to CRLF
# and diffs get noisy for changes that were never made.
#
# The app deploys to Linux hosts (Vercel/Netlify), which expect LF, and no file in this
# repo is binary, so LF everywhere is correct.
* text=auto eol=lf